# Go along (UI scenario), host a (k10): Dry Land from the gate, waits for b and c in stag0201, then takes matz01 into dng204b1
# alone (the offer with its notice for b and c) and stays there.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until frames>=600
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log a hosts Dry Land
idle until present=3,sealed>=300 or frames>=9000 fail stagechange
log b and c joined
idle until frames>=600
explore matz01 yes until stage=dng204b1,control or hp<=350
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=900
explore matz01 yes until stage=dng204b1,control or hp<=350
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=900
explore matz01 yes until stage=dng204b1,control
log a in dng204b1
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=900
idle until frames>=400000
